DEFAULT MODEL
-------------
The default NER model loaded by this package is "maskera-sv-ner"
(joelhagvall/maskera-sv-ner), maskera's own Swedish model. Its weights are
MIT-licensed. It is a derivative of KB-BERT (KBLab/bert-base-swedish-cased),
released CC0-1.0 (public domain) by the National Library of Sweden
(Kungliga biblioteket), acknowledged gratefully.

  Model:   https://huggingface.co/joelhagvall/maskera-sv-ner
  Base:    https://huggingface.co/KBLab/bert-base-swedish-cased

OPTIONAL MODEL ATTRIBUTION (Rampart)
------------------------------------
This package can optionally load "Rampart" (pass RAMPART_MODEL), created by
National Design Studio, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0).

  Model:   https://huggingface.co/nationaldesignstudio/rampart
  License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

If you redistribute the Rampart weights, or build a derivative / fine-tuned
model from them, CC BY 4.0 requires that you:
  1. Give appropriate credit to National Design Studio,
  2. Provide a link to the CC BY 4.0 license,
  3. Indicate if you made changes to the weights, and
  4. Do not imply National Design Studio endorses you or your use.

Rampart is trained on the ai4privacy/pii-masking-openpii-1.5m dataset,
also licensed CC BY 4.0.

Note: this package does not bundle any weights; they are downloaded at
runtime from the Hugging Face Hub. If you choose to vendor weights, ship
this NOTICE and the relevant model LICENSE alongside them.
